<title>INDIA: Indian March foodgrains stocks 15.49 mln tonnes.</title>
<headline>Indian March foodgrains stocks 15.49 mln tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-05-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian foodgrains stocks stood at 15.49 million tonnes at the end of March 1997 compared with 17.43 a month ago and 21.73 million same time last year, the government said on Saturday.</p>
<p>The government said in a statement foodgrains stocks as on April 1 were higher than the buffer stock norms of 14.5 million.</p>
<p>    FOODGRAINS STOCKS    Mar 97	Feb 97	Mar 96</p>
<p>    Rice			13.17	 13.56	 13.97</p>
<p>    Wheat			2.32	  3.87	  7.76</p>
<p>    Total		     15.49	 17.43	 21.73</p>
<p>Note - Figures are in million of tonnes.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
